; Area J: two copies at the same time, and reading a file while another
; one is written. Needs b_scale.script run first (RAM:nch/tree).
FailAt 21
Delete NC1:j1 NC1:j2 ALL QUIET
Delete RAM:nch/j3.bin QUIET
Run >RAM:nch/j1.log Copy RAM:nch/tree/Drawer0 NC1:j1 ALL CLONE QUIET
Run >RAM:nch/j2.log Copy RAM:nch/tree/Drawer5 NC1:j2 ALL CLONE QUIET
Run >RAM:nch/j3.log Copy NC1:tree/big_20MB.bin RAM:nch/j3.bin QUIET
Copy RAM:nch/tree/big_20MB.bin NC1:j_big.bin
Echo "== foreground copy done"
Lab wait
Wait 2
Status COMMAND Copy >NIL:
If NOT WARN
  Skip wait BACK
EndIf
Echo "== all copies done"
Type RAM:nch/j1.log RAM:nch/j2.log RAM:nch/j3.log
